160
00:14:43,088 --> 00:14:46,455
<i>#no fundo do infindo azul vinho

161
00:14:46,525 --> 00:14:48,592
<i>#Abrirei minha cabeça

162
00:14:48,661 --> 00:14:51,761
<i>#para o meu tempo sair

163
00:14:52,832 --> 00:14:55,562
<i>#adoraria afundar

164
00:14:56,635 --> 00:14:58,728
<i>#e ficar, ficar

165
00:14:58,804 --> 00:15:03,298
<i>#mas o mar não me quer hoje

166
